WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:35.030
Hunting the Solo Ship and its crew,
 Harulu and Gije of the Buff Clan...

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:41.350
launched a barrage of sub-light missiles
 on the immigrant planet Ajian.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:46.120
When Gije threatened to destroy Ajian if
the Ideon and Solo Ship weren't handed over,

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.620
the Ajian army and the Ideon responded by fighting back.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:12.250
In the end, the sub-light missiles used by the Buff
Clan were destroyed by the Ideon's new weapon.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:21.520
Afterwards, the Solo Ship left Ajian.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:27.290
<b>Gamus' Special Orders</b>

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:42.790
Alright!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.390
Keep going.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.270
The joints have been attached!

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.000
Can we move the leg again?

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.670
I think it'll be alright.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.610
Avoid the stardust!

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.240
Prepare the autopilot!

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.250
Ten o'clock, to the left! What's that light?

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.700
The radar's dead!

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.300
I can't tell!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.600
Prepare the anti-air cannons!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.520
Deck crew, get ready for battle!

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.770
Kasha, I'm going on ahead! Stay safe!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:13.600
Roger!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:17.600
You're fast.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:18.770
Of course!

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.770
Bes! Let's take refuge in the planet in front of us!

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:26.820
I'll leave it to you, Hatari!

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:27.650
All right!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.520
Changing to Ideo-Delta!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.520
Distract them with the front missiles!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.090
Roger!

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.940
Keep firing the missiles!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.080
I'm doing it!

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.160
They're fast!

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:03.720
They got behind us!

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:04.330
Missiles!

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.020
Did we hit them?

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.020
Cosmo!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:15.920
Can it really be?

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.100
That's the machine that turns into a giant?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:25.140
I don't believe this opponent deserves
 to be graced by Sir Gamus' presence.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.360
The shape is the same, but...

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.050
Are those the Giant Machines?

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.810
They seem like amateurs to me...

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.160
Run inside!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.330
It hurts!

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.040
Fard!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.130
Fard! Are you alright?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.240
It hurts... It hurts!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:20.750
That moron!

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:25.750
He crashed into rocks while trying
 to show off the Gondo Bau's abilities!

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:30.340
Just because you have high-grade missiles...

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:33.650
They're tough!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.780
Cosmo, to the right!

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:36.670
You take care of it!

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.160
Roger!

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:42.960
Go down!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:51.580
So that's all the Logo Dau aliens are capable of...

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:52.300
Sir Gamus!

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:56.300
I've received the position signal from
 Lady Harulu's Dorowa Zan!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:01.290
Good, we'll deal with the aliens
 after we have met Lady Harulu.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:03.060
Call back the Gondo Baus!

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:09.520
Don't let them escape, Cosmo!

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.960
Wait! There's an unidentified spacecraft!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.720
You'd better not get too close!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:14.620
But...

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:17.060
Bes is right, Deck.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.730
We don't know their battle strength;
 it wouldn't be wise to approach them.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:23.370
But still...

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.430
Sadis Zan, prepare for contact!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:47.900
Finish all operations!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.240
Maintain strict anti-air surveillance!

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:03.340
I, Gamus Ragu, have arrived.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:08.000
We had a run-in with the aliens on the way, 
and had to test their abilities...

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:09.910
I expected more reliable reinforcements.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:10.610
Are you dissatisfied?

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:16.250
Rumor has it that not even a single strand of
 grass will grow on the path you've walked.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.450
What an honor...

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.320
Even Lady Harulu acknowledges me.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:24.360
Supreme Commander Doba suggests taking
 proper caution against the Giant, Gamus.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:28.950
Yes... Is Gije Zaral no longer around?

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:32.860
Gije isn't here. I've cast him aside.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.830
Oh my, oh my.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.160
That's good treatment for him.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:43.250
I wonder if I'm fit to replace him.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:53.380
This is just going to keep on happening
 because we didn't beat them back there.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:55.340
Don't you feel sorry for him?

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:56.530
I know.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.030
But still, we can't just blindly rush into battle.

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:04.250
We can't endure these fights forever.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.420
Isn't there a solution to all of this?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.210
If the Buff Clan want the Ideon,
 can't we just hand it over to them?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.140
I'll talk to Bes and the others.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.490
We can't keep on running away forever.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:16.420
Yeah.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.820
That's the warship Sadis Zan.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.240
I'm not familiar with this war craft.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.140
This is where our unmanned probe was destroyed.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.020
Well then...

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:29.100
Cosmo, good job. You did well.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:30.330
What are we going to do?

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.640
We're landing on this planet.

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.920
The Solo Ship and Sol Conver need to be repaired.

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:39.200
That'll help us out.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:39.990
Bes.

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.570
Can I use half of the main computer?

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.690
I want to use it to analyze the
Sixth Civilization's language.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:46.960
Due to the last battle...

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:50.210
The computer is set for anti-air surveillance.

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:51.290
No way!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.570
How am I supposed to work?

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:54.850
Use your head.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.680
If you don't like it, let's just surrender.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:01.020
Wouldn't handing over the Ideon and Solo Ship
 to the Buff Clan solve all our problems?

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:02.060
You mustn't!

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:05.800
The current Buff Clan is an imperialistic
society ruled by Emperor Zuou.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.180
The entire universe would fall under Zuou's control!

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.120
Emperor Zuou?

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.820
We should think of the kids once in a while too.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.130
And if the Ide really existed...

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.680
We wouldn't have to go through all this trouble, right?

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.660
But if the Ide wasn't real...

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:24.600
You would have been wiped
out by the Buff Clan long ago.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:26.870
But...

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.340
Altitude 10,000 meters!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.330
Bes, where should we land in the water?

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.320
Water?

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.640
There doesn't seem to be any land.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:33.330
Really?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.440
Wow, a sea!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.280
There's water everywhere!

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:50.020
I want to go swimming.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.930
Me too!

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:57.360
It's been a while since I've seen the kids so excited.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.200
I'm getting excited too.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.410
Our food storage was starting to run out of salt too.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.000
I hope they let us off the ship.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.960
Okay, I'm going swimming!

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:21.080
Deck!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.530
Such fresh air!

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:29.500
Deck, wait!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.270
One, two, three, four, two, two...

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:33.290
Deck!

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:33.950
Here we go!

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:39.730
He doesn't know how to swim!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.440
Help me!

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:53.880
The ocean here is full of salt. He's not going to sink.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.590
I think I'd rather be in space.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.770
Stop complaining.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.780
This storm helps us to hide.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.070
This is going to take some time...

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.280
This is dangerous...

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:29.450
Should we try peace negotiations to buy some time,
  with the conditions Cosmo talked about?

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.840
In any case, Gamus must be searching for the Solo Ship.

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.680
Is he that tough of a person?

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.320
But if we offer to turn over the Ideon...

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.420
That should at least buy us a little time.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.850
Better than getting attacked during repairs.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:45.250
Let's do it!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.040
Karala wants to see us?

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:51.200
All right, let's meet the Logo Dau aliens!

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:52.840
Launch the Sadis Zan!

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:22.720
Well, then...

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:26.230
The Logo Dau aliens say they're willing 
to hand over the Ideon.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:28.470
I wonder how is Gamus going to respond?

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:32.500
He should simply focus on capturing the Ideon.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.390
Yes...

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.030
The results of Gije's research are about to become public.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.830
I want it more than ever.

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:47.410
Contact in five minutes!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.740
What about the Rogg Mack and Gondo Bau squads?

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.600
They're waiting above the clouds, as planned.

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.280
Good!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.130
Joliver, do you see them?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.080
They should be in sight soon.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:00.700
Right.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:19.790
Gamus Ragu.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.900
It has been a while, Lady Karala.

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:26.090
You've betrayed the Buff Clan and
 taken refuge with aliens.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.570
I can't forgive you!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.640
I'm not here to hear your reasoning.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.960
I'm here to give you the
terms of our negotiation.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.440
We will give you the Spaceship
Solo Ship and the Giant, Ideon,

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:39.430
in exchange for two Sadis Zan or 
Gataman Zan class ships.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:44.040
The Logo Dau aliens must be allowed to live.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.970
I shall wipe out all the aliens!

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:48.780
For the sake of my honor!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.970
Karala, he won't listen to us.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:51.820
Let's go!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:56.180
Because of people like you, there
 won't be peace in the universe!

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.220
I order you to kill the traitor!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:03.000
Rogg Mack and Gondo Bau squads! Commence attack!

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:13.780
Karala! Are you alright?!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.650
I'm fine! I can make it!

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:19.920
All units, spread out!

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:21.390
Watch out! It's a new model!

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.080
Joliver! Never mind the enemy! Just land!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.200
Let's do it!

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:42.380
Jump off!

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:44.890
Karala!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.140
Cosmo! We're okay!

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.410
Joliver, please take care of the Glenn Cannons!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.940
Karala, come to the cockpit!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:06.300
Did he refuse to negotiate?

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.450
That enemy general...

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:15.360
He won't be satisfied unless he destroys 
or captures the Ideon by himself!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:18.890
Gamus intends to fight us to the death...

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:22.930
Did they realize we were trying to stall for time?

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.710
That can't be!

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.710
Damn them!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:38.900
We did it!

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:39.850
Kasha! In front!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.170
Here's a double missile barrage!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:05.610
Retreat!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.590
First attack squad, fall back!

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:08.840
I won't let you retreat!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.160
What do you think we're here for?!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.140
You need to use the anchor attack!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.660
Roger! Use the anchor attack!

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:26.490
The Ideo-Nova got caught!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:27.700
Kasha! Hurry up!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:28.200
Roger!

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.940
The enemy's in front! It's a Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.710
Set the normal engine to maximum!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.660
Anti-air fire!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.160
Cut it out!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.370
Jeez...

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:48.570
We haven't seen that type of Heavy Mobile Mecha before!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.010
Open the main cannon!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:22.300
I'll give it a try.

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:29.920
Moera!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:30.850
Can you hear me?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.840
I hear you, Cosmo!

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.680
The Solo Ship is under attack!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.120
Let's dock into the Ideon!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:37.300
Okay!

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:38.130
All right!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.160
Hatari! What are you doing?!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.720
The power won't rise!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.360
Call Joliver back here!

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:06.150
There's water in the engine room!

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:10.760
Lou!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.020
Get out of the way!

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.340
Let's go back inside!

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:34.310
Why bother trading the Giant for a warship?

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.940
It's only a matter of time until they sink.

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:38.640
What?!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.080
Impossible!

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.330
Finish them off!

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:56.490
What are Cosmo and the others doing?!

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:57.390
Hatari!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.740
Can you raise us above the enemy's warship?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.370
The power is unstable!

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.110
Look at the Ideon gauge!

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:05.200
What's going on with the normal engine?!

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.230
If only we could understand the flow of the Ide energy...

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:10.250
The gauge should be on!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.250
Let's strike their main ship!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.580
If we defeat their commander...

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.360
Their fighters don't matter at all!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.180
Moera!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:25.260
Are you alright?

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:26.250
I'm okay!

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.080
That's the Giant?

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.060
Rogg Macks, head over there!

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:34.890
If all three of you attack at the same
 time, even the Giant should fall!

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.400
Even though the Ideon Gauge is on...

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:51.880
What's going on?!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.770
Cosmo! Is there anything I can do?

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.020
Just stay still!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:08.810
Again!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:10.390
That button...

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:12.250
The Mini Black Hole button!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.020
Cosmo!

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.920
Let's cut off the Normal Engine!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:16.910
What?

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.420
The Ide's power should protect us!

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:20.620
Trust in it!

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:22.160
Karala!

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:37.460
Even if Karala believes that, 
normal power should be enough!

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:38.720
Just watch!

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.690
Aim all the missiles to front!

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:45.050
I'm doing it! Glen Cannons too!

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:45.830
Okay!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:49.830
Fire!

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.480
The Rogg Mack?!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:10.710
We can do it!

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.290
That wasn't the Ide's power!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.290
The enemy thought they beat us and let their guard down.

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:16.890
We won because of our strategy!

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:18.380
Are they running away?

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:25.420
Did the Giant defeat a Heavy Mobile Mecha in one strike?

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:28.530
I won't hold back anymore!

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.950
I'll have the Bufu siblings attack them!

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:32.320
That Giant...

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:47.080
Karala has really become a member of the crew now.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.660
She's doing her best to befriend us all.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:55.410
Yeah. Hanging out with us aliens...

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:57.690
She can't act like a princess anymore.

00:21:57.770 --> 00:21:59.960
During today's fight, I was thinking...

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:02.110
Does the power of Ide really exist?

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:02.940
Well...

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:05.480
It sure exists in the Buff Clan's legend.

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:08.650
"The Ide will shine with the power of good".

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:10.300
If only that'd be true...

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.820
Has the Ide abandoned us?

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.950
Because we're just some group of self-centered humans?

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:17.230
Is that so, Bes?

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:18.700
Perhaps...

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:36.950
If the people of the Sixth Civilization were able 
to create the infinitely powerful Ideon...

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:39.230
Then why did they die out?

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:54.040
<i>The Buff Clan soldiers known as the Twin Devils...</i>

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:56.310
<i>...attack Cosmo and the others on the Solo Ship.</i>

00:22:57.420 --> 00:23:00.250
<i>The Solo Ship's barrier causes the
ocean water to evaporate,</i>

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:03.020
<i>while the enemy Rogg Macks draw near.</i>

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:08.400
<i>Can Cosmo and the others withstand
 the attack of the Devils?</i>

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.380
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon:
 "Attack of the Twin Devils"</i>

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:17.750
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:17.750
